    [Teardown]    vcu_gen.logout_rest    conn_alias=vcu_netact

Integrate vNE To Netact
    [Arguments]  ${ne_type}   ${netact_index}=${None}   ${gnb_index}=0   ${vdu_index}=0    ${fhgw_index}=0
    ...          ${security_mode}=No TLS
    [Documentation]  This keyword is used to integrate vNE(vDU, vCU, FHGW) to NetAct.
    ...
    ...  *AUTHOR* calla.wang@nokia-sbell.com
    ...
    ...    |    =Input Parameters=     | =Man.= | =Description= |
    ...    | ne_type | Yes | the NE type, it can be VDU, VCU, FHGW, case insensitive. |
    ...    | netact_index | No | NetAct index in testline configurtion file. Default is None. |
    ...    | vdu_index   | No  | vdu index in testline configuration file. Default is 0. |
    ...    | gnb_index   | No |  gnb index in testline configurtion file. Default is 0. |
    ...    | fhgw_index   | No  | fhgw index in testline configuration file. Default is 0. |
    ...    | security_mode | No | Security mode, default is 'No TLS'. |
    ...
    ...    - *netact_index*: NetAct can be configured as a list in testline configure file. This parameter is used
    ...    to specify which netact is used. If it set to None, the first netact that can ssh connect successfully will be selected.
    ...    Otherwise, the given netact index will be used.

    ...    *RETURN VALUE*
    ...   snapshot file path
    ${ne_id}   ${ne_stream}   ${ne_address}    run keyword   _Prepare ${ne_type} Info For Integrating Netact
    ...  gnb_index=${gnb_index}   vdu_index=${vdu_index}    fhgw_index=${fhgw_index}
    run keyword   netact_ope.integrate_${ne_type}_to_netact
    ...  ne_id=${ne_id}   ne_release=${ne_stream}  ne_address=${ne_address}   security_mode=${security_mode}
    ...  netact_index=${netact_index}

