Import SwBuild From Netact Temp Storage
    [Arguments]   ${mo_type}   ${version_id}   ${release}=None   ${clean_temp_storage}=False  ${alias}=default
    ...    ${netact_index}=${None}   ${ccr}=False
    [Documentation]   This keyword is used to import SW build to Netact.
    ...
    ...   *AUTHOR* runrun.shou@nokia-sbell.com
    ...
    ...  - *mo_type*: string mo_type: managed object type, 'CNF' by default
    ...  - *release*: (string|list(string)) release: software package argument. A string or a list can be used
    ...  - *clean_temp_storage*: if SW package has to be deleted from NetAct software temporary storage after import
    ...  - *netact_index*: NetAct index in testline configurtion file. Default is None.
    ...                    NetAct can be configured as a list in testline configure file. This parameter is used
    ...                    to identify which netact will be used. If it is set to None, the first netact that can be connected
    ...                    by ssh will be selected. Otherwise, the given netact index will be used.
    ...  - *ccr*: enables/disables distribution to Central Container Registry (CCR)
    netact_ope.import_swbuild_from_netAct_temp_storage_taf  ${mo_type}  ${version_id}  ${release}  ${alias}  ${clean_temp_storage}
    ...    netact_index=${netact_index}  ccr=${ccr}
    ${check_import_result}  netact_ope.check_swbuild_is_imported_to_netAct_taf  ${version_id}  ${mo_type}  ${alias}  netact_index=${netact_index}
    [Return]    ${check_import_result}

